@@text
@@text Not run. Builds of 2026-11-07 (Common, Compat, Equipment, Delight, Brewing, Devtools, Engineering), installed by the
@@text parallel build session if at all (check `jar_archive/displaced/`). Moved: 89 classes (35 client mixins, the JEI and
@@text WTHIT plugins and helpers, tooltip stacks, GUI title plaques, compound effect tooltip) to Compat; Detail Armor Bar compat,
@@text its 2 mixins and the tint sheets (now `creativeequipment:textures/gui/*_tint.png`) to Equipment; CaffeinatedEffectMixin
