## SQ-CIF-01 | old configs carried: Compat has [jei] [gui_title] [toasts] [tooltips] [coaster] [wthit] with the old values, Equipment has [armor_overflow]; no moved-class errors
@group B (full pack, world from before the carve)
@commands prep_srv with the seven builds; boot; `grep -E "Mixin apply failed\|InvalidMixinException\|ClassNotFoundException.*creativecommon\.(compat\|mixin)" logs/latest.log`; open `config/creativecompat-common.toml`, `creativeequipment-common.toml`, `creativecommon-common.toml`
@pass boot reaches Done, no hits; Compat file has the six sections with the pack's edited values (e.g. `[jei]`, `[toasts]` as in `configs_edited/`), Equipment has `[armor_overflow]`; Common's file no longer has them after Forge corrects it
@fails ConfigRename merge order in CreativeCompat / CreativeEquipment constructors
@from batches/r1113/c3_a3.qb
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException
bootreject ClassNotFoundException.*creativecommon\.(compat|mixin)
shell for s in jei gui_title toasts tooltips coaster wthit shrapnel surface vein_undo; do printf "%s compat=%s old=%s\n" $s "$(grep -c "^\[$s\]" config/creativecompat-common.toml)" "$(grep -c "^\[$s\]" cif_old_common.toml cif_old_eng.toml | awk -F: '{n+=$2} END {print n}')"; done
shell for s in jei gui_title toasts tooltips coaster wthit; do grep -q "^\[$s\]" config/creativecompat-common.toml || { echo "missing [$s]"; exit 1; }; done
shell grep -q "^\[armor_overflow\]" config/creativeequipment-common.toml
shell python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/cif_carry_check.py cif_old_common.toml config/creativecompat-common.toml config/creativeequipment-common.toml
shell grep -cE "^\[(jei|gui_title|toasts|tooltips|coaster|wthit|armor_overflow)\]" config/creativecommon-common.toml; true
look the carry log line (`[swaps] config sections ... carried` or similar) in latest.log; DIFF lines: every carried key keeps the old value (a DIFF on a key Forge renamed or re-ranged is judged by hand); the last count is 0 once Forge has corrected Common's file (may need the stop: Forge rewrites on load, so 0 expected). The Engineering sections [shrapnel] [surface] [vein_undo] also land in Compat (SQ-ENGM carry, same mechanism)

## SQ-CIF-02 | Better Beacons potions under creativebrewing: mixes exist; drinking phantom_bane gives Better Beacons Phantom Bane
@group B (same world)
@commands before the swap: put a `creativecommon:long_reach` potion, a `creativecommon:long_phantom_bane` tipped arrow in a chest (2026-11-06 build); after: `/data get block` on the chest; `/zq recipes` brewing mixes for `creativebrewing:long_long_reach`; `/give @p potion{Potion:"creativebrewing:phantom_bane"}` and drink
@pass chest items read `creativebrewing:` ids; mixes present; drinking gives Better Beacons Phantom Bane
@fails swap list not read (data/creativebrewing/swaps), PotionByNameRemapMixin
@from batches/r1113/c3_b1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# self-contained since r1118 (rowfix-1, 2026-11-18): bot spawn from r1113 c3_b1 SQ-C3B-setup
> forceload add 0 0
> setblock 0 199 0 minecraft:stone
> setblock 0 199 2 minecraft:stone
> execute unless entity cb run pbot spawn cb 0.5 200 0.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> cdevtest potion creativebrewing:long_long_reach
> cdevtest potion creativebrewing:long_reach minecraft:redstone
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=potion done= 30
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=potion potion=creativebrewing:long_long_reach registered=true
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=potion potion=creativebrewing:long_reach ingredient=minecraft:redstone output="?minecraft:potion creativebrewing:long_long_reach
> clear cb
> pbot hunger cb 10
> item replace entity cb weapon.mainhand with minecraft:potion{Potion:"creativebrewing:phantom_bane"}
> pbot eat cb
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=pbot\.useitem bot=cb end=finish item=minecraft:potion 30
> cdevtest player cb
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=player name=cb effects= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=player name=cb effects=\S*better_beacons:phantom_bane:
reject \[cdevtest\] .*(done=0|error=)
look old-world half (a chest with creativecommon:long_reach potions from an 2026-11-06 save) not run: no 2026-11-06 build kept to make the save

## SQ-CIF-03 | Farmer's Respite coffee: Caffeinated plus a hidden Phantom Bane of the same length; rest stat not -24000; reset to 0 when it ends
@group B (same boot)
@commands fake player drinks a Farmer's Respite coffee; `/effect` list; wait for effect end; `/data get entity` TimeSinceRest stat via `/scoreboard` on `minecraft.custom:minecraft.time_since_rest`
@pass Caffeinated plus a hidden Phantom Bane of the same duration; rest stat not pushed to -24000; reset to 0 when Phantom Bane ends
@fails CaffeinatedPhantomBane not registered (farmersrespite gate) or the mixin compartment gate
@from batches/r1113/c3_b1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# self-contained since r1118 (rowfix-1, 2026-11-18): bot spawn from r1113 c3_b1 SQ-C3B-setup
> forceload add 0 0
> setblock 0 199 0 minecraft:stone
> setblock 0 199 2 minecraft:stone
> execute unless entity cb run pbot spawn cb 0.5 200 0.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> effect clear cb
> zc3 rest cb
> clear cb
> pbot hunger cb 10
> item replace entity cb weapon.mainhand with farmersrespite:coffee
> pbot eat cb
# judge-5, 2026-11-18: the item merge turns farmersrespite:coffee into rusticdelight:coffee in the hand (r1118 s36)
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=pbot\.useitem bot=cb end=finish item=(farmersrespite|rusticdelight):coffee 30
> cdevtest player cb
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=player name=cb effects= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=player name=cb effects=\S*farmersrespite:caffeinated:
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=player name=cb effects=\S*better_beacons:phantom_bane:
capture PB verb=player name=cb effects=\S*better_beacons:phantom_bane:\d+:(\d+)
> zc3 rest cb
> cdevtest tickwarp {PB+80}
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tickwarp end=done 600
> cdevtest player cb
> zc3 rest cb
waitlog \[c3\] done 20
reject rest cb: -2\d{4}
reject \[cdevtest\] .*(done=0|error=)
look Caffeinated and Phantom Bane durations equal (third field of each in the first `verb=player` effects list); the rest stat after the drink is not near -24000; after Phantom Bane ends the stat reads near 0 (a few seconds of ticks, under about 200). If the coffee item id differs (farmersrespite:coffee is the cup), the `verb=pbot.eat` line says so (`result=` and `using=`)

